"""Synthetic clause catalogue for the Experiment 3 clause library.

Every clause here is written for this project. It is synthetic, Singapore-flavoured
illustration text, NOT legal advice and NOT copied from any real agreement.

Conventions
-----------
* Defined terms are written in Title Case exactly as defined (e.g. "Confidential Information").
* Cross-references to another clause of the same template are written as {ref:KEY};
  scripts/build_synthetic.py renders them as "Clause N (Title)" using that template's numbering.
* variant: "definition" | "standard" (in a template) | "fallback" (alternative to a standard
  clause, with a deviation cost) | "optional" (extra clause requested case by case).
"""

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Definitions (one clause per defined term, shared by templates that list them)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINITIONS = {
    "AFFILIATE": ("Affiliate", "means, in relation to a party, any entity that directly or indirectly controls, is controlled by, or is under common control with that party, where control means the ownership of more than 50 per cent. of the voting rights or the power to appoint a majority of the board."),
    "APPLICABLE_LAW": ("Applicable Law", "means all laws, regulations, notices, guidelines and directions of any governmental or regulatory authority (including the Monetary Authority of Singapore) that apply to a party or to the subject matter of this Agreement, as amended from time to time."),
    "BUSINESS_DAY": ("Business Day", "means a day (other than a Saturday, Sunday or gazetted public holiday) on which commercial banks are open for general business in Singapore."),
    "CONFIDENTIAL_INFORMATION": ("Confidential Information", "means all information, in any form, disclosed by or on behalf of the Disclosing Party to the Receiving Party in connection with the Purpose, including investment strategies, portfolio holdings, pricing, client identities and terms of business, together with all notes and analyses prepared from such information."),
    "PURPOSE": ("Purpose", "means the evaluation, negotiation and, if agreed, implementation of a possible business relationship between the parties concerning investment management or fund distribution services."),
    "REPRESENTATIVES": ("Representatives", "means, in relation to a party, its Affiliates and its and their directors, officers, employees, professional advisers and auditors who need to know the Confidential Information for the Purpose."),
    "PERSONAL_DATA": ("Personal Data", "has the meaning given to it in the Personal Data Protection Act 2012 of Singapore."),
    "CLIENT": ("Client", "means the person named as the client in the Schedule, being an accredited investor or institutional investor within the meaning of the Securities and Futures Act 2001."),
    "INVESTMENT_MANAGER": ("Investment Manager", "means the fund management company named in the Schedule, which holds a capital markets services licence for fund management issued by the Monetary Authority of Singapore."),
    "PORTFOLIO": ("Portfolio", "means the cash, securities and other assets of the Client placed under the management of the Investment Manager under this Agreement, together with all income and proceeds."),
    "NAV": ("Net Asset Value", "means the value of the assets of the Portfolio or the Fund (as the context requires) less its liabilities, calculated by the administrator in accordance with the valuation policy in force."),
    "MANAGEMENT_FEE": ("Management Fee", "means the fee payable to the Investment Manager for its management services, calculated in accordance with {ref:FEE_CLAUSE}."),
    "PERFORMANCE_FEE": ("Performance Fee", "means the fee payable to the Investment Manager by reference to the increase in Net Asset Value above the High-Water Mark."),
    "HIGH_WATER_MARK": ("High-Water Mark", "means the highest Net Asset Value at the end of any previous performance period in respect of which a Performance Fee was paid, adjusted for subscriptions and withdrawals."),
    "KEY_PERSON": ("Key Person", "means the individual or individuals named as key persons in the Schedule or in the Fund Documents, being the portfolio managers principally responsible for investment decisions."),
    "CUSTODIAN": ("Custodian", "means the bank or trust company appointed by the Client to hold the assets of the Portfolio, which shall be independent of the Investment Manager."),
    "LOSSES": ("Losses", "means all losses, liabilities, damages, costs (including reasonable legal fees) and expenses, but excluding indirect or consequential loss and loss of profit."),
    "SANCTIONS": ("Sanctions", "means any economic or financial sanctions or trade embargoes administered by the United Nations, Singapore (including under the Monetary Authority of Singapore Act 1970), the European Union, the United Kingdom or the United States, and Sanctioned Person means any person who is the target of Sanctions."),
    "DISTRIBUTOR": ("Distributor", "means the person appointed under this Agreement to market and arrange subscriptions for Shares, as named in the Schedule."),
    "FUND": ("Fund", "means the open-ended investment fund (including any variable capital company sub-fund) managed by the Investment Manager and described in the Fund Documents."),
    "SHARES": ("Shares", "means participating shares or units of any class in the Fund."),
    "TERRITORY": ("Territory", "means Singapore and any other jurisdiction set out in the Schedule as agreed in writing from time to time."),
    "ELIGIBLE_INVESTOR": ("Eligible Investor", "means an accredited investor or institutional investor within the meaning of section 4A of the Securities and Futures Act 2001, or an equivalent professional investor in another part of the Territory."),
    "INVESTOR": ("Investor", "means the person named as the investor in this letter, including any permitted transferee of its interest in the Fund."),
    "SIMILAR_INVESTOR": ("Similar Investor", "means any other investor in the Fund whose aggregate subscription is equal to or less than the subscription of the Investor, excluding Affiliates of the Investment Manager and employee vehicles."),
    "FUND_DOCUMENTS": ("Fund Documents", "means the constitution, private placement memorandum and subscription documents of the Fund, each as amended from time to time."),
    "DEALING_DAY": ("Dealing Day", "means the first Business Day of each calendar month and any other day determined by the directors of the Fund."),
    "SUBSCRIPTION_AMOUNT": ("Subscription Amount", "means the amount in the base currency of the Fund that the Investor applies to invest, as stated in the subscription form."),
}

